                <mxCell id="x_i1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;" value="&lt;b&gt;Expectation&lt;/b&gt; = how often × how much, added up across the whole bag.&lt;br&gt;Win rate alone is only half the story." vertex="1">
